# Morrowind Temple: Endryn Llethan's "Disease Carrier" (TT_DiseaseCarrier). In the High Fane Endryn Llethan asks the
# player to talk the holy woman Tanusea Veloth out of Vivec ("leave Vivec City": 10). At disposition 80 she goes as a
# favor ("Do this as a favor for me." 2: 50, TeleportTanusea moves her to Tel Fyr once the player is out of Vivec);
# Endryn Llethan pays in cure blight potions (100).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel; bribes, repeated until they land, raise Tanusea. The AddItem of gold stands
# in for money the player earned on the way.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_maargan_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_diseasecarrier_start
run
player->PositionCell -1031 -150 -616 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "endryn llethan"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk endryn llethan
ask duties
ask leave Vivec City
expect GetJournalIndex TT_DiseaseCarrier == 10
bye
end

case tt_diseasecarrier_tanusea
run
player->AddItem Gold_001 2000
player->PositionCell 731 850 -85 0 "Vivec, Arena Pit"
until 600 "tanusea veloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tanusea veloth
persuade bribe100 until "tanusea veloth"->GetDisposition >= 80
ask leave Vivec City
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TT_DiseaseCarrier == 50
bye
end

case tt_diseasecarrier_done
run
player->PositionCell -1031 -150 -616 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "endryn llethan"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk endryn llethan
ask leave Vivec City
expect GetJournalIndex TT_DiseaseCarrier == 100
bye
end
